  <lrml:Statements key="book-1"><lrml:Comment>第一编　总则</lrml:Comment>
    <lrml:Statements key="chapter-2"><lrml:Comment>第二章　自然人</lrml:Comment>
      <lrml:Statements key="section-1"><lrml:Comment>第一节　民事权利能力和民事行为能力</lrml:Comment>
        <lrml:Statements key="card-np-01"><lrml:Comment>【规则卡片 np-01】自然人民事权利能力的开始与终止｜挂载：第13条、第14条、第15条｜争点：自然人何时享有、何时丧失民事权利能力；出生、死亡时间如何认定｜适用条件：自然人已出生且尚未死亡｜除外：出生、死亡证明记载的时间可被其他足以推翻的证据推翻｜法律效果：具有民事权利能力，依法享有民事权利、承担民事义务；出生/死亡时间：证明 ＞ 户籍或其他有效身份登记；有足以推翻的其他证据时以该证据为准；自然人的民事权利能力一律平等（第14条，宣示性规定，不形式化）</lrml:Comment>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c15-cert-flag"><lrml:Comment>有出生证明或死亡证明（辅助）（第15条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c15-cert-flag"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:recordedInCertificate"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:hasCertificate"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c13"><lrml:Comment>自然人从出生时起到死亡时止，具有民事权利能力（第13条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c13"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:naturalPerson"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:born"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:dead"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:legalCapacity"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c15-cert"><lrml:Comment>出生、死亡时间以出生证明、死亡证明记载的时间为准（第15条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c15-cert"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:recordedInCertificate"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:rebuttedByEvidence"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:eventTime"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c15-reg"><lrml:Comment>没有出生证明、死亡证明的，以户籍登记或者其他有效身份登记记载的时间为准（第15条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c15-reg"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:recordedInRegistration"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:hasCertificate"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:rebuttedByEvidence"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:eventTime"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c15-proof"><lrml:Comment>有其他证据足以推翻以上记载时间的，以该证据证明的时间为准（第15条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c15-proof"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:provenByOtherEvidence"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:eventTime"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:rebuttedByEvidence"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
        </lrml:Statements>
        <lrml:Statements key="card-np-02"><lrml:Comment>【规则卡片 np-02】胎儿利益的特殊保护｜挂载：第16条｜争点：胎儿是否具有民事权利能力｜适用条件：涉及遗产继承、接受赠与等胎儿利益保护｜除外：胎儿娩出时为死体的｜法律效果：胎儿视为具有民事权利能力（拟制）；娩出时为死体的，其民事权利能力自始不存在</lrml:Comment>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c16"><lrml:Comment>涉及遗产继承、接受赠与等胎儿利益保护的，胎儿视为具有民事权利能力（第16条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c16"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:fetus"/><ruleml:Var>F</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Or><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:fetalInheritanceInterest"/><ruleml:Var>F</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:fetalGiftInterest"/><ruleml:Var>F</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:otherFetalInterest"/><ruleml:Var>F</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Or><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:stillborn"/><ruleml:Var>F</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:deemedLegalCapacity"/><ruleml:Var>F</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c16-still"><lrml:Comment>胎儿娩出时为死体的，其民事权利能力自始不存在（第16条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c16-still"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:fetus"/><ruleml:Var>F</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:stillborn"/><ruleml:Var>F</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Neg><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:deemedLegalCapacity"/><ruleml:Var>F</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Neg></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
        </lrml:Statements>
        <lrml:Statements key="card-np-03"><lrml:Comment>【规则卡片 np-03】自然人民事行为能力的分类｜挂载：第17条、第18条、第19条、第20条、第21条、第22条｜争点：自然人属于完全、限制还是无民事行为能力人｜适用条件：年满十八周岁为成年人，不满十八周岁为未成年人；成年人为完全民事行为能力人；十六周岁以上、以自己的劳动收入为主要生活来源的未成年人，视为完全民事行为能力人；八周岁以上的未成年人为限制民事行为能力人；不满八周岁的未成年人为无民事行为能力人；不能辨认自己行为的成年人为无民事行为能力人；不能完全辨认自己行为的成年人为限制民事行为能力人｜除外：八周岁以上的未成年人不能辨认自己行为的，为无民事行为能力人｜法律效果：完全民事行为能力人可以独立实施民事法律行为；限制民事行为能力人实施民事法律行为须由法定代理人代理或同意、追认；无民事行为能力人由法定代理人代理实施民事法律行为</lrml:Comment>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c18-full"><lrml:Comment>成年人为完全民事行为能力人（第18条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c18-full"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:adult"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:cannotDiscern"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:cannotFullyDiscern"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:fullCapacity"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c18-emancipated"><lrml:Comment>十六周岁以上、以自己劳动收入为主要生活来源的未成年人，视为完全民事行为能力人（第18条第2款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c18-emancipated"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:minor"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:age16plus"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:ownLabourIncomeMainSource"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:cannotDiscern"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:cannotFullyDiscern"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:fullCapacity"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Neg><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:limitedCapacity"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Neg></ruleml:And></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c19"><lrml:Comment>八周岁以上的未成年人为限制民事行为能力人（第19条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c19"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:minor"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:under8"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:limitedCapacity"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c20"><lrml:Comment>不满八周岁的未成年人为无民事行为能力人（第20条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c20"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:minor"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:under8"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:noCapacity"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c21-1"><lrml:Comment>不能辨认自己行为的成年人为无民事行为能力人（第21条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c21-1"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:adult"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:cannotDiscern"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:noCapacity"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c21-2"><lrml:Comment>八周岁以上的未成年人不能辨认自己行为的，为无民事行为能力人（优先于第19条）（第21条第2款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c21-2"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:minor"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:cannotDiscern"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:noCapacity"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Neg><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:limitedCapacity"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Neg></ruleml:And></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c22"><lrml:Comment>不能完全辨认自己行为的成年人为限制民事行为能力人（第22条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c22"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:adult"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:cannotFullyDiscern"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:cannotDiscern"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:limitedCapacity"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c17-adult"><lrml:Comment>十八周岁以上的自然人为成年人（第17条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c17-adult"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:naturalPerson"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:age18plus"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:adult"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c17-minor"><lrml:Comment>不满十八周岁的自然人为未成年人（第17条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c17-minor"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:naturalPerson"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:under18"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:minor"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
          <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c18-act"><lrml:Comment>完全民事行为能力人可以独立实施民事法律行为（第18条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c18-act"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:fullCapacity"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Permission key="c18-act-h0"><lrml:Paraphrase>完全民事行为能力人可以独立实施民事法律行为</lrml:Paraphrase><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:actIndependently"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Permission></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c19-rep"><lrml:Comment>限制民事行为能力人实施民事法律行为由法定代理人代理或者经其同意、追认（纯获利益与相适应的行为除外，见第145条）（第19条、第22条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c19-rep"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:limitedCapacity"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:needsRepresentationOrConsent"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c20-rep"><lrml:Comment>无民事行为能力人由其法定代理人代理实施民事法律行为（第20条、第21条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c20-rep"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:noCapacity"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:actsOnlyThroughRepresentative"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
        </lrml:Statements>
        <lrml:Statements key="card-np-04"><lrml:Comment>【规则卡片 np-04】无民事行为能力人、限制民事行为能力人的法定代理｜挂载：第23条｜争点：谁是无/限制民事行为能力人的法定代理人｜适用条件：是无民事行为能力人或限制民事行为能力人的监护人｜法律效果：监护人是其法定代理人</lrml:Comment>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c23"><lrml:Comment>无民事行为能力人、限制民事行为能力人的监护人是其法定代理人（第23条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c23"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianOf"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Or><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:noCapacity"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:limitedCapacity"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Or></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:legalRepresentative"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
        </lrml:Statements>
        <lrml:Statements key="card-np-05"><lrml:Comment>【规则卡片 np-05】成年人欠缺民事行为能力的认定与恢复｜挂载：第24条｜争点：谁可以申请认定、恢复成年人的民事行为能力｜适用条件：不能辨认或不能完全辨认自己行为的成年人；申请人为利害关系人或有关组织；恢复：智力、精神健康已恢复，经本人、利害关系人或有关组织申请｜法律效果：可以申请法院认定为无或限制民事行为能力人；法院可以认定其恢复为限制或完全民事行为能力人</lrml:Comment>
          <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c24-1"><lrml:Comment>利害关系人或者有关组织可以申请认定成年人为无或限制民事行为能力人（第24条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c24-1"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:adult"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Or><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:cannotDiscern"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:cannotFullyDiscern"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Or><ruleml:Or><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:interestedParty"/><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:concernsPerson"/><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:relevantOrg"/><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:Or></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Permission key="c24-1-h0"><lrml:Paraphrase>利害关系人或者有关组织可以申请认定成年人为无或限制民事行为能力人</lrml:Paraphrase><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:applyCapacityDeclaration"/><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Permission></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
          <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c24-2"><lrml:Comment>经本人、利害关系人或者有关组织申请，人民法院可以认定其恢复为限制或完全民事行为能力人（第24条第2款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c24-2"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:declaredIncapable"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:capacityRecovered"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:appliedForRestoration"/><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Or><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isSelf"/><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:interestedParty"/><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:relevantOrg"/><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Or></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Permission key="c24-2-h0"><lrml:Paraphrase>经本人、利害关系人或者有关组织申请，人民法院可以认定其恢复为限制或完全民事行为能力人</lrml:Paraphrase><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Var>court</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:declareCapacityRestored"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Permission></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c24-3"><lrml:Comment>有关组织包括居民委员会、村民委员会、学校、医疗机构、妇女联合会、残疾人联合会、依法设立的老年人组织、民政部门等（第24条第3款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c24-3"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Or><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:residentsCommittee"/><ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:villagersCommittee"/><ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:school"/><ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:medicalInstitution"/><ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:womensFederation"/><ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:disabledPersonsFederation"/><ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:elderlyOrganization"/><ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:civilAffairsDept"/><ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Or></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:relevantOrg"/><ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
        </lrml:Statements>
        <lrml:Statements key="card-np-06"><lrml:Comment>【规则卡片 np-06】自然人的住所｜挂载：第25条｜争点：自然人的住所如何确定｜适用条件：户籍登记或其他有效身份登记记载的居所｜除外：经常居所与住所不一致的｜法律效果：以登记的居所为住所；不一致时经常居所视为住所</lrml:Comment>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c25-1"><lrml:Comment>自然人以户籍登记或者其他有效身份登记记载的居所为住所（第25条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c25-1"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Or><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:registeredResidence"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:otherIdRecordResidence"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Or><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:habitualResidenceDiffers"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:domicile"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c25-2"><lrml:Comment>经常居所与住所不一致的，经常居所视为住所（第25条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c25-2"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:habitualResidence"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:habitualResidenceDiffers"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:domicile"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
        </lrml:Statements>
      </lrml:Statements>
      <lrml:Statements key="section-2"><lrml:Comment>第二节　监护</lrml:Comment>
        <lrml:Statements key="card-np-07"><lrml:Comment>【规则卡片 np-07】家庭成员间的抚养、赡养义务｜挂载：第26条｜争点：父母与子女之间的法定义务｜适用条件：父母与未成年子女；成年子女与父母｜法律效果：父母负有抚养、教育和保护义务；成年子女负有赡养、扶助和保护义务</lrml:Comment>
          <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c26-1"><lrml:Comment>父母对未成年子女负有抚养、教育和保护的义务（第26条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c26-1"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:parentOf"/><ruleml:Var>Pa</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:minor"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Obligation key="c26-1-h0"><lrml:Paraphrase>父母对未成年子女负有抚养、教育和保护的义务</lrml:Paraphrase><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Var>Pa</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:slot><lrml:AuxiliaryParty/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:raiseEducateProtect"/><ruleml:Var>Pa</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Obligation></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
          <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c26-2"><lrml:Comment>成年子女对父母负有赡养、扶助和保护的义务（第26条第2款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c26-2"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:childOf"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>Pa</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:adult"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Obligation key="c26-2-h0"><lrml:Paraphrase>成年子女对父母负有赡养、扶助和保护的义务</lrml:Paraphrase><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:slot><lrml:AuxiliaryParty/><ruleml:Var>Pa</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:supportAssistProtect"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>Pa</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Obligation></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
        </lrml:Statements>
        <lrml:Statements key="card-np-08"><lrml:Comment>【规则卡片 np-08】未成年人的法定监护｜挂载：第27条｜争点：谁担任未成年人的监护人｜适用条件：父母是未成年子女的监护人；父母已经死亡或者没有监护能力的，依次由祖父母外祖父母、兄姐、其他愿意的个人或组织担任；后顺序的人仅在前顺序无人时担任｜除外：其他愿意担任的个人或组织须经住所地居委会、村委会或民政部门同意；已依遗嘱、协议、指定确定监护人的，不再按法定顺序｜法律效果：成为未成年人的监护人</lrml:Comment>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c-ward-minor"><lrml:Comment>未成年人需要监护（视为完全民事行为能力人的除外，参照第39条第1项）（第27条第1款、第39条；doctrine）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c-ward-minor"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:minor"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:fullCapacity"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:needsGuardian"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c27-parent-flag"><lrml:Comment>父母担任监护人（辅助）（第27条第2款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c27-parent-flag"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:parentOf"/><ruleml:Var>Pa</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianOf"/><ruleml:Var>Pa</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:hasParentGuardian"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c-able"><lrml:Comment>“有监护能力”：完全民事行为能力人，且无身体健康、经济条件等方面的不适宜情形（总则编解释第6条）（第27条第2款、第28条；spc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c-able"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:fullCapacity"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:unfitForGuardianship"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:ableGuardian"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c-eligible"><lrml:Comment>“依法具有监护资格的人”：第27、28条所列有监护能力的亲属（第27条第2款、第28条；doctrine）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c-eligible"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Or><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:grandparentOf"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:olderSiblingOf"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:spouseOf"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:parentOf"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:childOf"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:closeRelativeOf"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Or><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:ableGuardian"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:eligibleGuardian"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c27-1"><lrml:Comment>父母是未成年子女的监护人（第27条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c27-1"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:parentOf"/><ruleml:Var>Pa</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:minor"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:deceased"/><ruleml:Var>Pa</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:lacksGuardianCapacity"/><ruleml:Var>Pa</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianOf"/><ruleml:Var>Pa</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c27-2-1"><lrml:Comment>父母已经死亡或者没有监护能力的，由有监护能力的祖父母、外祖父母担任监护人（第一顺序）（第27条第2款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c27-2-1"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:minor"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:grandparentOf"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:ableGuardian"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:hasParentGuardian"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:specialGuardianSet"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianOf"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:minorOrder1Available"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c27-2-2"><lrml:Comment>没有第一顺序的，由兄、姐担任（第二顺序）（第27条第2款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c27-2-2"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:minor"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:olderSiblingOf"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:ableGuardian"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:hasParentGuardian"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:specialGuardianSet"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:minorOrder1Available"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianOf"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:minorOrder2Available"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c27-2-3"><lrml:Comment>前两顺序都没有的，由其他愿意担任监护人的个人或者组织担任，但须经被监护人住所地的居民委员会、村民委员会或者民政部门同意（第27条第2款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c27-2-3"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:minor"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:willingToServe"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Or><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:ableGuardian"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:organization"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Or><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:approvedByLocalAuthority"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:hasParentGuardian"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:specialGuardianSet"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:minorOrder1Available"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:minorOrder2Available"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianOf"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
        </lrml:Statements>
        <lrml:Statements key="card-np-09"><lrml:Comment>【规则卡片 np-09】无或限制民事行为能力成年人的法定监护｜挂载：第28条｜争点：谁担任无或限制民事行为能力成年人的监护人｜适用条件：依次由配偶，父母、子女，其他近亲属，其他愿意的个人或组织担任｜除外：其他愿意担任的个人或组织须经住所地居委会、村委会或民政部门同意；已有意定监护人的，依意定监护｜法律效果：成为该成年人的监护人</lrml:Comment>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c-ward-adult"><lrml:Comment>无民事行为能力或者限制民事行为能力的成年人需要监护（第28条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c-ward-adult"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:adult"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Or><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:noCapacity"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:limitedCapacity"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Or></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:needsGuardian"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:incapableAdult"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c28-1"><lrml:Comment>无或限制民事行为能力的成年人，由有监护能力的配偶担任监护人（第一顺序）（第28条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c28-1"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:incapableAdult"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:spouseOf"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:ableGuardian"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:specialGuardianSet"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianOf"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:adultOrder1Available"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c28-2"><lrml:Comment>没有第一顺序的，由父母、子女担任（第二顺序）（第28条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c28-2"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:incapableAdult"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Or><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:parentOf"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:childOf"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Or><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:ableGuardian"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:specialGuardianSet"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:adultOrder1Available"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianOf"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:adultOrder2Available"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c28-3"><lrml:Comment>再没有的，由其他近亲属担任（第三顺序）（第28条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c28-3"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:incapableAdult"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:closeRelativeOf"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:ableGuardian"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:specialGuardianSet"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:adultOrder1Available"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:adultOrder2Available"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianOf"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:adultOrder3Available"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c28-4"><lrml:Comment>前三顺序都没有的，由其他愿意担任监护人的个人或者组织担任，但须经被监护人住所地的居民委员会、村民委员会或者民政部门同意（第28条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c28-4"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:incapableAdult"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:willingToServe"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Or><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:ableGuardian"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:organization"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Or><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:approvedByLocalAuthority"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:specialGuardianSet"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:adultOrder1Available"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:adultOrder2Available"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:adultOrder3Available"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianOf"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
        </lrml:Statements>
        <lrml:Statements key="card-np-10"><lrml:Comment>【规则卡片 np-10】遗嘱监护｜挂载：第29条｜争点：父母能否以遗嘱指定监护人｜适用条件：被监护人的父母担任监护人｜除外：被指定的人不同意担任的，依第27、28条确定（司法解释）｜法律效果：父母可以通过遗嘱指定监护人；被指定的人同意担任的，为监护人</lrml:Comment>
          <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c29"><lrml:Comment>担任监护人的父母可以通过遗嘱指定监护人（第29条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c29"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:parentOf"/><ruleml:Var>Pa</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianOf"/><ruleml:Var>Pa</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Permission key="c29-h0"><lrml:Paraphrase>担任监护人的父母可以通过遗嘱指定监护人</lrml:Paraphrase><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Var>Pa</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:designateGuardianByWill"/><ruleml:Var>Pa</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Permission></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c29-effect"><lrml:Comment>遗嘱生效时被指定的人同意担任的，为监护人；不同意的，依第27、28条确定（总则编解释第7条）（第29条；spc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c29-effect"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:designatedByParentsWill"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:agreesToServe"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:hasParentGuardian"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianOf"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:specialGuardianSet"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
        </lrml:Statements>
        <lrml:Statements key="card-np-11"><lrml:Comment>【规则卡片 np-11】协议监护｜挂载：第30条｜争点：能否通过协议确定监护人｜适用条件：协议各方依法具有监护资格｜法律效果：协议确定的人为监护人；协议确定监护人应当尊重被监护人的真实意愿</lrml:Comment>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c30"><lrml:Comment>依法具有监护资格的人之间可以协议确定监护人（第30条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c30"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:agreedGuardian"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:eligibleGuardian"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianOf"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:specialGuardianSet"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
          <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c30-wish"><lrml:Comment>协议确定监护人应当尊重被监护人的真实意愿（第30条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c30-wish"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:agreedGuardian"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Obligation key="c30-wish-h0"><lrml:Paraphrase>协议确定监护人应当尊重被监护人的真实意愿</lrml:Paraphrase><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:slot><lrml:AuxiliaryParty/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:respectWardsWishes"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Obligation></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
        </lrml:Statements>
        <lrml:Statements key="card-np-12"><lrml:Comment>【规则卡片 np-12】指定监护与临时监护｜挂载：第31条｜争点：对监护人的确定有争议时如何处理｜适用条件：对监护人的确定有争议｜法律效果：由住所地居委会、村委会或民政部门指定；不服或者直接，可以申请法院指定；指定须尊重真实意愿、按最有利原则在有资格的人中指定；指定前无人保护的，由住所地居委会、村委会、有关组织或民政部门担任临时监护人；被指定的人为监护人；不得擅自变更，擅自变更的不免除其责任</lrml:Comment>
          <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c31-1"><lrml:Comment>对监护人的确定有争议的，由被监护人住所地的居民委员会、村民委员会或者民政部门指定监护人（第31条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c31-1"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianDispute"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:localAuthority"/><ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Permission key="c31-1-h0"><lrml:Paraphrase>对监护人的确定有争议的，由被监护人住所地的居民委员会、村民委员会或者民政部门指定监护人</lrml:Paraphrase><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:designateGuardian"/><ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Permission></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
          <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c31-1-court"><lrml:Comment>有关当事人对指定不服的，或者直接，可以向人民法院申请指定监护人（第31条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c31-1-court"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianDispute"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:concernedParty"/><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Permission key="c31-1-court-h0"><lrml:Paraphrase>有关当事人对指定不服的，或者直接，可以向人民法院申请指定监护人</lrml:Paraphrase><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:applyCourtDesignation"/><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Permission></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
          <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c31-2"><lrml:Comment>指定机关应当尊重被监护人的真实意愿，按照最有利于被监护人的原则在依法具有监护资格的人中指定（第31条第2款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c31-2"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:designator"/><ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Obligation key="c31-2-h0"><lrml:Paraphrase>指定机关应当尊重被监护人的真实意愿，按照最有利于被监护人的原则在依法具有监护资格的人中指定</lrml:Paraphrase><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:slot><lrml:AuxiliaryParty/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:designateAmongEligibleInBestInterest"/><ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Obligation></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c31-3"><lrml:Comment>指定监护人前，被监护人的合法权益处于无人保护状态的，由被监护人住所地的居民委员会、村民委员会或者民政部门等担任临时监护人（第31条第3款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c31-3"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianDispute"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:unprotectedBeforeDesignation"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:localAuthority"/><ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:temporaryGuardian"/><ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c31-designated"><lrml:Comment>被指定的人为监护人（第31条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c31-designated"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:designatedGuardian"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianOf"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:specialGuardianSet"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
          <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c31-4"><lrml:Comment>监护人被指定后，不得擅自变更（第31条第4款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c31-4"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:designatedGuardian"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Prohibition key="c31-4-h0"><lrml:Paraphrase>监护人被指定后，不得擅自变更</lrml:Paraphrase><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:changeGuardianUnilaterally"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Prohibition></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c31-4-liab"><lrml:Comment>擅自变更的，不免除被指定的监护人的责任（第31条第4款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c31-4-liab"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:designatedGuardian"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:changedWithoutAuthorization"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Neg><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:releasedFromGuardianResponsibility"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Neg></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
        </lrml:Statements>
        <lrml:Statements key="card-np-13"><lrml:Comment>【规则卡片 np-13】民政部门等担任监护人（机关监护）｜挂载：第32条｜争点：没有具有监护资格的人时谁担任监护人｜适用条件：没有依法具有监护资格的人｜法律效果：由民政部门担任；也可以由具备条件的住所地居委会、村委会担任</lrml:Comment>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c-has-eligible"><lrml:Comment>存在依法具有监护资格的人（辅助）（第32条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c-has-eligible"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:eligibleGuardian"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:hasEligibleGuardian"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c32"><lrml:Comment>没有依法具有监护资格的人的，监护人由民政部门担任（第32条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c32"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:needsGuardian"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:hasEligibleGuardian"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianOf"/><ruleml:Ind>civilAffairs</ruleml:Ind><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
          <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c32-committee"><lrml:Comment>也可以由具备履行监护职责条件的被监护人住所地的居民委员会、村民委员会担任（第32条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c32-committee"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:needsGuardian"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:hasEligibleGuardian"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:committeeAbleToServe"/><ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Permission key="c32-committee-h0"><lrml:Paraphrase>也可以由具备履行监护职责条件的被监护人住所地的居民委员会、村民委员会担任</lrml:Paraphrase><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:serveAsGuardian"/><ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Permission></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
        </lrml:Statements>
        <lrml:Statements key="card-np-14"><lrml:Comment>【规则卡片 np-14】成年人意定监护｜挂载：第33条｜争点：完全民事行为能力的成年人能否事先确定自己的监护人｜适用条件：协商时具有完全民事行为能力的成年人；与近亲属或其他愿意的个人、组织事先协商，以书面形式确定｜法律效果：在其丧失或部分丧失民事行为能力时，由该监护人履行监护职责</lrml:Comment>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c33"><lrml:Comment>完全民事行为能力的成年人可以书面事先确定监护人，在其丧失或者部分丧失民事行为能力时，由该监护人履行监护职责（第33条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c33"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:adult"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:writtenVoluntaryGuardianAgreement"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:madeWhileFullyCapable"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Or><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:noCapacity"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:limitedCapacity"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Or></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianOf"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:specialGuardianSet"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
        </lrml:Statements>
        <lrml:Statements key="card-np-15"><lrml:Comment>【规则卡片 np-15】监护人的职责｜挂载：第34条、第35条｜争点：监护人有哪些职责，违反时的后果｜适用条件：担任监护人｜除外：为维护被监护人利益的，可以处分其财产｜法律效果：代理被监护人实施民事法律行为，保护其合法权益；不履行职责或侵害被监护人合法权益的，应当承担法律责任；紧急情况下被监护人无人照料的，住所地居委会、村委会或民政部门应当安排临时生活照料；按最有利于被监护人的原则履行职责；不得处分被监护人的财产；未成年人：根据年龄和智力尊重其意愿；成年人：最大程度尊重其意愿，不得干涉其能独立处理的事务；监护人依法履行职责产生的权利受法律保护（第34条第2款，宣示性，不形式化）</lrml:Comment>
          <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c34-1"><lrml:Comment>监护人的职责是代理被监护人实施民事法律行为，保护其人身权利、财产权利以及其他合法权益（第34条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c34-1"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianOf"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Obligation key="c34-1-h0"><lrml:Paraphrase>监护人的职责是代理被监护人实施民事法律行为，保护其人身权利、财产权利以及其他合法权益</lrml:Paraphrase><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:slot><lrml:AuxiliaryParty/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:representAndProtectWard"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Obligation></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c34-3"><lrml:Comment>监护人不履行监护职责或者侵害被监护人合法权益的，应当承担法律责任（第34条第3款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c34-3"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianOf"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Or><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:failsGuardianDuty"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:infringesWardRights"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Or></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:bearsLegalLiability"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
          <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c35-best"><lrml:Comment>监护人应当按照最有利于被监护人的原则履行监护职责（第35条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c35-best"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianOf"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Obligation key="c35-best-h0"><lrml:Paraphrase>监护人应当按照最有利于被监护人的原则履行监护职责</lrml:Paraphrase><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:slot><lrml:AuxiliaryParty/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:actInWardsBestInterest"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Obligation></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
          <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c34-4"><lrml:Comment>因突发事件等紧急情况被监护人无人照料的，被监护人住所地的居民委员会、村民委员会或者民政部门应当安排必要的临时生活照料措施（第34条第4款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c34-4"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianOf"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianTemporarilyUnableByEmergency"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:wardUnattended"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:localAuthority"/><ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Obligation key="c34-4-h0"><lrml:Paraphrase>因突发事件等紧急情况被监护人无人照料的，被监护人住所地的居民委员会、村民委员会或者民政部门应当安排必要的临时生活照料措施</lrml:Paraphrase><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:slot><lrml:AuxiliaryParty/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:arrangeTemporaryCare"/><ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Obligation></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
          <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c35-dispose"><lrml:Comment>监护人除为维护被监护人利益外，不得处分被监护人的财产（第35条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c35-dispose"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianOf"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:forWardsInterest"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Prohibition key="c35-dispose-h0"><lrml:Paraphrase>监护人除为维护被监护人利益外，不得处分被监护人的财产</lrml:Paraphrase><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:disposeWardProperty"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Prohibition></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
          <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c35-minor"><lrml:Comment>未成年人的监护人作出与被监护人利益有关的决定时，应当根据其年龄和智力状况尊重其真实意愿（第35条第2款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c35-minor"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianOf"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:minor"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:decisionAffectingWard"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Obligation key="c35-minor-h0"><lrml:Paraphrase>未成年人的监护人作出与被监护人利益有关的决定时，应当根据其年龄和智力状况尊重其真实意愿</lrml:Paraphrase><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:slot><lrml:AuxiliaryParty/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:respectWishesByAgeAndIntellect"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Obligation></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
          <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c35-adult"><lrml:Comment>成年人的监护人应当最大程度地尊重被监护人的真实意愿，保障并协助其实施相适应的民事法律行为（第35条第3款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c35-adult"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianOf"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:adult"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Obligation key="c35-adult-h0"><lrml:Paraphrase>成年人的监护人应当最大程度地尊重被监护人的真实意愿，保障并协助其实施相适应的民事法律行为</lrml:Paraphrase><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:slot><lrml:AuxiliaryParty/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:respectWishesToMaximum"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Obligation></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
          <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c35-noninterf"><lrml:Comment>对被监护人有能力独立处理的事务，监护人不得干涉（第35条第3款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c35-noninterf"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianOf"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:adult"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:wardCanHandleAlone"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Prohibition key="c35-noninterf-h0"><lrml:Paraphrase>对被监护人有能力独立处理的事务，监护人不得干涉</lrml:Paraphrase><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:interfereInAffair"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Prohibition></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
        </lrml:Statements>
        <lrml:Statements key="card-np-16"><lrml:Comment>【规则卡片 np-16】撤销监护人资格｜挂载：第36条、第37条｜争点：何种情形下撤销监护人资格，由谁申请｜适用条件：严重损害身心健康；怠于或无法履行且拒绝委托致危困；其他严重侵害合法权益的行为；有关个人或组织申请｜法律效果：人民法院撤销其监护人资格，安排临时监护措施并依法指定监护人；其他个人和组织未及时申请的，民政部门应当申请；被撤销后，依法负担抚养费、赡养费、扶养费的父母、子女、配偶等应当继续负担</lrml:Comment>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c36-ground"><lrml:Comment>撤销事由：严重损害被监护人身心健康；怠于或无法履行且拒绝委托致其危困；其他严重侵害其合法权益的行为（第36条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c36-ground"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianOf"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Or><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:seriouslyHarmsWard"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:neglectOrRefusalLeavesWardInDistress"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:otherSeriousInfringement"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Or></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianshipRevocationGround"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
          <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c36-1"><lrml:Comment>有撤销事由的，人民法院根据有关个人或者组织的申请，撤销其监护人资格（第36条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c36-1"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianshipRevocationGround"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:revocationApplied"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Obligation key="c36-1-h0"><lrml:Paraphrase>有撤销事由的，人民法院根据有关个人或者组织的申请，撤销其监护人资格</lrml:Paraphrase><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Var>court</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:revokeGuardianship"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Obligation></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c36-2"><lrml:Comment>可以申请撤销的有关个人、组织（第36条第2款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c36-2"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:concernsWard"/><ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Or><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:eligibleGuardian"/><ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:relevantOrg"/><ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:minorsProtectionOrg"/><ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Or></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:qualifiedRevocationApplicant"/><ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
          <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c36-3"><lrml:Comment>其他个人和组织未及时申请的，民政部门应当向人民法院申请（第36条第3款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c36-3"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianshipRevocationGround"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:othersFailedToApplyInTime"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Obligation key="c36-3-h0"><lrml:Paraphrase>其他个人和组织未及时申请的，民政部门应当向人民法院申请</lrml:Paraphrase><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Var>civilAffairs</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:applyForRevocation"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Obligation></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
          <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c36-after"><lrml:Comment>撤销后安排必要的临时监护措施，并按照最有利于被监护人的原则依法指定监护人（第36条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c36-after"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianshipRevoked"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Obligation key="c36-after-h0"><lrml:Paraphrase>撤销后安排必要的临时监护措施，并按照最有利于被监护人的原则依法指定监护人</lrml:Paraphrase><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Var>court</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:arrangeTemporaryMeasuresAndDesignate"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Obligation></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c36-effect"><lrml:Comment>被撤销监护人资格的，不再是监护人（第36条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c36-effect"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianshipRevoked"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Neg><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianOf"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Neg></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
          <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c37"><lrml:Comment>依法负担抚养费、赡养费、扶养费的父母、子女、配偶等，被撤销监护人资格后，应当继续履行负担的义务（第37条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c37"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianshipRevoked"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:owesMaintenance"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Obligation key="c37-h0"><lrml:Paraphrase>依法负担抚养费、赡养费、扶养费的父母、子女、配偶等，被撤销监护人资格后，应当继续履行负担的义务</lrml:Paraphrase><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:slot><lrml:AuxiliaryParty/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:continuePayingMaintenance"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Obligation></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
        </lrml:Statements>
        <lrml:Statements key="card-np-17"><lrml:Comment>【规则卡片 np-17】恢复监护人资格｜挂载：第38条｜争点：被撤销资格的监护人能否恢复资格｜适用条件：被撤销资格的是父母或者子女；确有悔改表现，并经其申请｜除外：对被监护人实施故意犯罪的｜法律效果：人民法院可以在尊重被监护人真实意愿的前提下视情况恢复；法院指定的监护人与被监护人的监护关系同时终止；恢复后重新成为监护人</lrml:Comment>
          <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c38"><lrml:Comment>被撤销资格的父母或者子女，确有悔改表现的，经其申请，人民法院可以视情况恢复其监护人资格（对被监护人实施故意犯罪的除外）（第38条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c38"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianshipRevoked"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Or><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:parentOf"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:childOf"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Or><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianRepented"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:appliedForRestoration"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:intentionalCrimeAgainstWard"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Permission key="c38-h0"><lrml:Paraphrase>被撤销资格的父母或者子女，确有悔改表现的，经其申请，人民法院可以视情况恢复其监护人资格（对被监护人实施故意犯罪的除外）</lrml:Paraphrase><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Var>court</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:restoreGuardianship"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Permission></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c38-end"><lrml:Comment>恢复后，人民法院指定的监护人与被监护人的监护关系同时终止（第38条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c38-end"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianshipRestored"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:designatedGuardian"/><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianshipTerminated"/><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c38-restored"><lrml:Comment>恢复监护人资格的，重新成为监护人（第38条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c38-restored"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianshipRestored"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianOf"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
        </lrml:Statements>
        <lrml:Statements key="card-np-18"><lrml:Comment>【规则卡片 np-18】监护关系的终止｜挂载：第39条｜争点：监护关系何时终止｜适用条件：被监护人取得或恢复完全民事行为能力；监护人丧失监护能力；一方死亡；法院认定的其他情形｜法律效果：监护关系终止，不再是监护人；仍需监护的，应当另行确定监护人</lrml:Comment>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c39-1"><lrml:Comment>被监护人取得或恢复完全民事行为能力、监护人丧失监护能力、一方死亡或者法院认定的其他情形，监护关系终止（第39条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c39-1"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:servedAsGuardian"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Or><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:fullCapacity"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:lostGuardianCapacity"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:died"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:died"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:courtFindsTermination"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Or></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianshipTerminated"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c39-end"><lrml:Comment>监护关系终止的，不再是监护人（第39条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c39-end"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianshipTerminated"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Neg><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianOf"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Neg></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c39-2"><lrml:Comment>监护关系终止后，被监护人仍然需要监护的，应当依法另行确定监护人（第39条第2款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c39-2"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianshipTerminated"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:needsGuardian"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:needsNewGuardian"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
        </lrml:Statements>
      </lrml:Statements>
      <lrml:Statements key="section-3"><lrml:Comment>第三节　宣告失踪和宣告死亡</lrml:Comment>
        <lrml:Statements key="card-np-19"><lrml:Comment>【规则卡片 np-19】宣告失踪的条件｜挂载：第40条、第41条｜争点：何时可以申请宣告失踪，下落不明从何时起算｜适用条件：下落不明满二年；由利害关系人申请｜除外：战争期间下落不明的，自战争结束之日或有关机关确定之日起算｜法律效果：利害关系人可以申请宣告失踪；下落不明自失去音讯之日起算</lrml:Comment>
          <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c40"><lrml:Comment>自然人下落不明满二年的，利害关系人可以申请宣告其为失踪人（第40条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c40"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:missingFor2Years"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:interestedParty"/><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Permission key="c40-h0"><lrml:Paraphrase>自然人下落不明满二年的，利害关系人可以申请宣告其为失踪人</lrml:Paraphrase><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:applyMissingDeclaration"/><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Permission></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c41-1"><lrml:Comment>下落不明的时间自失去音讯之日起计算（第41条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c41-1"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:lostContactOn"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:missingDuringWar"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:missingSince"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c41-2"><lrml:Comment>战争期间下落不明的，自战争结束之日或者有关机关确定的下落不明之日起计算（第41条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c41-2"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:missingDuringWar"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Or><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:warEndedFor"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:authorityDeterminedMissingDate"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Or></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:missingSince"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
        </lrml:Statements>
        <lrml:Statements key="card-np-20"><lrml:Comment>【规则卡片 np-20】失踪人的财产代管｜挂载：第42条、第43条、第44条｜争点：谁代管失踪人的财产，代管人的职责与变更｜适用条件：已被宣告失踪｜除外：代管有争议、没有或无代管能力的，由法院指定｜法律效果：由配偶、成年子女、父母或其他愿意的人代管；妥善管理；从失踪人财产中支付其所欠税款、债务和其他费用；因故意或重大过失造成损失的，承担赔偿责任；不履职、侵害财产权益、丧失代管能力的，利害关系人可申请变更；代管人有正当理由也可申请；变更后的代管人有权请求原代管人移交财产并报告</lrml:Comment>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c42-flag"><lrml:Comment>有第42条第1款规定的代管人（辅助）（第42条第2款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c42-flag"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:custodianCandidate"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:hasCustodianCandidate"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c42-1"><lrml:Comment>失踪人的财产由其配偶、成年子女、父母或者其他愿意担任财产代管人的人代管（第42条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c42-1"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:declaredMissing"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Or><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:spouseOf"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:adultChildOf"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:parentOf"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:willingCustodian"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Or><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:custodyDispute"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:lacksCustodyCapacity"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:custodianCandidate"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
          <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c43-1"><lrml:Comment>财产代管人应当妥善管理失踪人的财产，维护其财产权益（第43条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c43-1"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:propertyCustodian"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Obligation key="c43-1-h0"><lrml:Paraphrase>财产代管人应当妥善管理失踪人的财产，维护其财产权益</lrml:Paraphrase><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:slot><lrml:AuxiliaryParty/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:manageMissingPersonsProperty"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Obligation></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
          <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c44-1"><lrml:Comment>财产代管人不履行职责、侵害失踪人财产权益或者丧失代管能力的，利害关系人可以申请变更（第44条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c44-1"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:propertyCustodian"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Or><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:failsCustodyDuty"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:infringesMissingPersonsProperty"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:lacksCustodyCapacity"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Or><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:interestedParty"/><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Permission key="c44-1-h0"><lrml:Paraphrase>财产代管人不履行职责、侵害失踪人财产权益或者丧失代管能力的，利害关系人可以申请变更</lrml:Paraphrase><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:applyChangeCustodian"/><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Permission></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
          <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c43-2"><lrml:Comment>失踪人所欠税款、债务和应付的其他费用，由财产代管人从失踪人的财产中支付（第43条第2款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c43-2"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:propertyCustodian"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:owedByMissingPerson"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Obligation key="c43-2-h0"><lrml:Paraphrase>失踪人所欠税款、债务和应付的其他费用，由财产代管人从失踪人的财产中支付</lrml:Paraphrase><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:payFromMissingPersonsProperty"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Obligation></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
          <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c43-3"><lrml:Comment>财产代管人因故意或者重大过失造成失踪人财产损失的，应当承担赔偿责任（第43条第3款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c43-3"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:propertyCustodian"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Or><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:custodianIntent"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:custodianGrossNegligence"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Or><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:missingPersonsPropertyLost"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Obligation key="c43-3-h0"><lrml:Paraphrase>财产代管人因故意或者重大过失造成失踪人财产损失的，应当承担赔偿责任</lrml:Paraphrase><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:slot><lrml:AuxiliaryParty/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:compensateMissingPerson"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Obligation></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
          <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c44-2"><lrml:Comment>财产代管人有正当理由的，可以申请变更财产代管人（第44条第2款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c44-2"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:propertyCustodian"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:justifiedReason"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Permission key="c44-2-h0"><lrml:Paraphrase>财产代管人有正当理由的，可以申请变更财产代管人</lrml:Paraphrase><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:applyChangeCustodian"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Permission></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
          <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c44-3"><lrml:Comment>变更后的财产代管人有权请求原财产代管人及时移交有关财产并报告代管情况（第44条第3款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c44-3"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:custodianChanged"/><ruleml:Var>K0</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>K1</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Right key="c44-3-h0"><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Var>K1</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:slot><lrml:AuxiliaryParty/><ruleml:Var>K0</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:demandHandoverAndReport"/><ruleml:Var>K1</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>K0</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Right></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
          <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c42-2"><lrml:Comment>代管有争议的，由人民法院指定的人代管（第42条第2款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c42-2"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:declaredMissing"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:custodyDispute"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Obligation key="c42-2-h0"><lrml:Paraphrase>代管有争议的，由人民法院指定的人代管</lrml:Paraphrase><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Var>court</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:designatePropertyCustodian"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Obligation></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
          <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c42-2b"><lrml:Comment>没有前款规定的人或者其无代管能力的，由人民法院指定的人代管（第42条第2款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c42-2b"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:declaredMissing"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:hasCustodianCandidate"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Obligation key="c42-2b-h0"><lrml:Paraphrase>没有前款规定的人或者其无代管能力的，由人民法院指定的人代管</lrml:Paraphrase><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Var>court</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:designatePropertyCustodian"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Obligation></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
        </lrml:Statements>
        <lrml:Statements key="card-np-21"><lrml:Comment>【规则卡片 np-21】失踪宣告的撤销｜挂载：第45条｜争点：失踪人重新出现后如何处理｜适用条件：失踪人重新出现，经本人或利害关系人申请｜法律效果：人民法院应当撤销失踪宣告；有权请求财产代管人移交财产并报告</lrml:Comment>
          <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c45-1"><lrml:Comment>失踪人重新出现，经本人或者利害关系人申请，人民法院应当撤销失踪宣告（第45条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c45-1"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:declaredMissing"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:reappeared"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:appliedToRevokeMissing"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Obligation key="c45-1-h0"><lrml:Paraphrase>失踪人重新出现，经本人或者利害关系人申请，人民法院应当撤销失踪宣告</lrml:Paraphrase><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Var>court</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:revokeMissingDeclaration"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Obligation></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
          <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c45-2"><lrml:Comment>失踪人重新出现，有权请求财产代管人及时移交有关财产并报告代管情况（第45条第2款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c45-2"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:declaredMissing"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:reappeared"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:propertyCustodian"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Right key="c45-2-h0"><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:slot><lrml:AuxiliaryParty/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:demandHandoverAndReport"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Right></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
        </lrml:Statements>
        <lrml:Statements key="card-np-22"><lrml:Comment>【规则卡片 np-22】宣告死亡的条件｜挂载：第41条、第46条｜争点：何时可以申请宣告死亡｜适用条件：下落不明满四年；或因意外事件下落不明满二年；由利害关系人申请｜除外：因意外事件下落不明，经有关机关证明不可能生存的，不受二年限制｜法律效果：利害关系人可以申请宣告死亡</lrml:Comment>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c46-cond"><lrml:Comment>宣告死亡的条件：下落不明满四年；因意外事件下落不明满二年；或因意外事件下落不明且经有关机关证明不可能生存（不受二年限制）（第46条第1款、第46条第2款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c46-cond"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Or><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:missingFor4Years"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:accidentMissingFor2Years"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:accidentMissing"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:certifiedCannotSurvive"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:Or></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:deathDeclarationConditionsMet"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
          <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c46-apply"><lrml:Comment>符合条件的，利害关系人可以申请宣告该自然人死亡（第46条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c46-apply"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:deathDeclarationConditionsMet"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:interestedParty"/><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Permission key="c46-apply-h0"><lrml:Paraphrase>符合条件的，利害关系人可以申请宣告该自然人死亡</lrml:Paraphrase><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:applyDeathDeclaration"/><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Permission></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
        </lrml:Statements>
        <lrml:Statements key="card-np-23"><lrml:Comment>【规则卡片 np-23】宣告失踪与宣告死亡的关系｜挂载：第47条｜争点：同时有人申请宣告失踪、有人申请宣告死亡时如何处理｜适用条件：符合宣告死亡的条件｜法律效果：人民法院应当宣告死亡</lrml:Comment>
          <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c47"><lrml:Comment>有的申请宣告死亡、有的申请宣告失踪，符合宣告死亡条件的，人民法院应当宣告死亡（第47条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c47"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:deathDeclarationApplied"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:missingDeclarationApplied"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:deathDeclarationConditionsMet"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Obligation key="c47-h0"><lrml:Paraphrase>有的申请宣告死亡、有的申请宣告失踪，符合宣告死亡条件的，人民法院应当宣告死亡</lrml:Paraphrase><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Var>court</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:declareDeath"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Obligation></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
        </lrml:Statements>
        <lrml:Statements key="card-np-24"><lrml:Comment>【规则卡片 np-24】宣告死亡的法律效果｜挂载：第48条、第49条、第51条｜争点：被宣告死亡的人何时视为死亡，有何后果｜适用条件：已被宣告死亡｜除外：因意外事件下落不明的，以意外事件发生之日为死亡日期｜法律效果：判决作出之日视为死亡日期；婚姻关系自死亡宣告之日起消除；实际未死亡的，其在被宣告死亡期间实施的民事法律行为效力不受影响</lrml:Comment>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c48-1"><lrml:Comment>宣告死亡的判决作出之日视为其死亡的日期（第48条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c48-1"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:declaredDead"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:judgmentDate"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:accidentMissing"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:deemedDeathDate"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c48-2"><lrml:Comment>因意外事件下落不明宣告死亡的，意外事件发生之日视为其死亡的日期（第48条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c48-2"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:declaredDead"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:accidentMissing"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:accidentDate"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:deemedDeathDate"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c49"><lrml:Comment>被宣告死亡但并未死亡的，不影响其在被宣告死亡期间实施的民事法律行为的效力（第49条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c49"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:declaredDead"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:actuallyAlive"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:actDuringDeclaredDeath"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:validityUnaffectedByDeathDeclaration"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c51-1"><lrml:Comment>被宣告死亡的人的婚姻关系，自死亡宣告之日起消除（第51条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c51-1"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:declaredDead"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:spouseOf"/><ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:deathDeclarationRevoked"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:marriageDissolved"/><ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
        </lrml:Statements>
        <lrml:Statements key="card-np-25"><lrml:Comment>【规则卡片 np-25】死亡宣告的撤销及其效果｜挂载：第50条、第51条、第52条、第53条｜争点：被宣告死亡的人重新出现后的法律后果｜适用条件：被宣告死亡的人重新出现，经本人或利害关系人申请｜除外：配偶再婚或向婚姻登记机关书面声明不愿意恢复的，婚姻不恢复｜法律效果：人民法院应当撤销死亡宣告；婚姻关系自撤销之日起自行恢复；不得以未经本人同意为由主张子女被收养无效；有权请求依继承编取得其财产的人返还；无法返还的给予适当补偿；利害关系人隐瞒真实情况取得财产的，返还并赔偿损失</lrml:Comment>
          <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c50"><lrml:Comment>被宣告死亡的人重新出现，经本人或者利害关系人申请，人民法院应当撤销死亡宣告（第50条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c50"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:declaredDead"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:reappeared"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:appliedToRevokeDeath"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Obligation key="c50-h0"><lrml:Paraphrase>被宣告死亡的人重新出现，经本人或者利害关系人申请，人民法院应当撤销死亡宣告</lrml:Paraphrase><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Var>court</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:revokeDeathDeclaration"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Obligation></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c51-2"><lrml:Comment>死亡宣告被撤销的，婚姻关系自撤销之日起自行恢复（配偶再婚或者书面声明不愿意恢复的除外）（第51条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c51-2"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:deathDeclarationRevoked"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:spouseOf"/><ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:spouseRemarried"/><ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:declaredUnwillingToRestore"/><ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:marriageRestored"/><ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
          <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c52"><lrml:Comment>子女在其被宣告死亡期间被依法收养的，不得以未经本人同意为由主张收养行为无效（第52条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c52"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:deathDeclarationRevoked"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:childOf"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:adoptedDuringDeclaredDeath"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Prohibition key="c52-h0"><lrml:Paraphrase>子女在其被宣告死亡期间被依法收养的，不得以未经本人同意为由主张收养行为无效</lrml:Paraphrase><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:claimAdoptionVoidForLackOfConsent"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Prohibition></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
          <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c53-1"><lrml:Comment>被撤销死亡宣告的人有权请求依照继承编取得其财产的民事主体返还财产（第53条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c53-1"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:deathDeclarationRevoked"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:acquiredUnderSuccession"/><ruleml:Var>Y</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Right key="c53-1-h0"><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:slot><lrml:AuxiliaryParty/><ruleml:Var>Y</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:claimPropertyReturn"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>Y</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Right></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
          <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c53-1b"><lrml:Comment>无法返还的，应当给予适当补偿（第53条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c53-1b"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:deathDeclarationRevoked"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:acquiredUnderSuccession"/><ruleml:Var>Y</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:cannotReturn"/><ruleml:Var>Y</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Obligation key="c53-1b-h0"><lrml:Paraphrase>无法返还的，应当给予适当补偿</lrml:Paraphrase><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Var>Y</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:slot><lrml:AuxiliaryParty/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:giveAppropriateCompensation"/><ruleml:Var>Y</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Obligation></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
          <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c53-2"><lrml:Comment>利害关系人隐瞒真实情况致使他人被宣告死亡而取得其财产的，除返还财产外，还应当赔偿损失（第53条第2款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c53-2"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:concealedTruth"/><ruleml:Var>Y</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:acquiredByDeathDeclaration"/><ruleml:Var>Y</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Obligation key="c53-2-h0"><lrml:Paraphrase>利害关系人隐瞒真实情况致使他人被宣告死亡而取得其财产的，除返还财产外，还应当赔偿损失</lrml:Paraphrase><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Var>Y</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:slot><lrml:AuxiliaryParty/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:returnAndCompensateLoss"/><ruleml:Var>Y</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Obligation></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
        </lrml:Statements>
      </lrml:Statements>
      <lrml:Statements key="section-4"><lrml:Comment>第四节　个体工商户和农村承包经营户</lrml:Comment>
        <lrml:Statements key="card-np-26"><lrml:Comment>【规则卡片 np-26】个体工商户｜挂载：第54条、第56条｜争点：个体工商户的认定及其债务承担｜适用条件：自然人从事工商业经营，经依法登记｜法律效果：为个体工商户，可以起字号；个人经营的以个人财产承担；家庭经营或无法区分的以家庭财产承担</lrml:Comment>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c54"><lrml:Comment>自然人从事工商业经营，经依法登记，为个体工商户（第54条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c54"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:naturalPerson"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:industrialCommercialOperation"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:registeredAsBusiness"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:individualBusiness"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c56-1a"><lrml:Comment>个体工商户的债务，个人经营的，以个人财产承担（第56条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c56-1a"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:individualBusiness"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:debtOfOperator"/><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:personallyOperated"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:payableFromPersonalAssets"/><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c56-1b"><lrml:Comment>家庭经营的，以家庭财产承担；无法区分的，以家庭财产承担（第56条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c56-1b"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:individualBusiness"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:debtOfOperator"/><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Or><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:familyOperated"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:operationIndistinguishable"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Or></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:payableFromFamilyAssets"/><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
          <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c54-name"><lrml:Comment>个体工商户可以起字号（第54条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c54-name"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:individualBusiness"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Permission key="c54-name-h0"><lrml:Paraphrase>个体工商户可以起字号</lrml:Paraphrase><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:adoptTradeName"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Permission></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
        </lrml:Statements>
        <lrml:Statements key="card-np-27"><lrml:Comment>【规则卡片 np-27】农村承包经营户｜挂载：第55条、第56条｜争点：农村承包经营户的认定及其债务承担｜适用条件：农村集体经济组织成员，依法取得土地承包经营权，从事家庭承包经营｜除外：事实上由部分成员经营的，以该部分成员的财产承担｜法律效果：为农村承包经营户；债务以从事承包经营的农户财产承担</lrml:Comment>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c55"><lrml:Comment>农村集体经济组织的成员，依法取得农村土地承包经营权，从事家庭承包经营的，为农村承包经营户（第55条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c55"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:collectiveMember"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:obtainedLandContractRight"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:familyContractOperation"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:ruralContractHousehold"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c56-2a"><lrml:Comment>农村承包经营户的债务，以从事农村土地承包经营的农户财产承担（第56条第2款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c56-2a"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:ruralContractHousehold"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:debtOfOperator"/><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:operatedByPartOfMembers"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:payableFromHouseholdAssets"/><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c56-2b"><lrml:Comment>事实上由农户部分成员经营的，以该部分成员的财产承担（第56条第2款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c56-2b"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:ruralContractHousehold"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:debtOfOperator"/><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:operatedByPartOfMembers"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:payableFromOperatingMembersAssets"/><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
        </lrml:Statements>
      </lrml:Statements>
    </lrml:Statements>
  </lrml:Statements>
  <lrml:Statements key="priorities"><lrml:Comment>显式优先关系（“除非”条件由 lrml2ddl.py 自动转为优先关系）</lrml:Comment>
    <lrml:OverrideStatement key="ov-c21-2--c19"><lrml:Comment>不能辨认自己行为的八周岁以上未成年人为无民事行为能力人（第21条第2款），排除第19条</lrml:Comment><lrml:Override over="#c21-2" under="#c19"/></lrml:OverrideStatement>
    <lrml:OverrideStatement key="ov-c18-emancipated--c19"><lrml:Comment>视为完全民事行为能力人（第18条第2款），排除第19条</lrml:Comment><lrml:Override over="#c18-emancipated" under="#c19"/></lrml:OverrideStatement>
    <lrml:OverrideStatement key="ov-c36-effect--c27-1"><lrml:Comment>被撤销监护人资格（第36条）的，不再依第27–33条担任监护人</lrml:Comment><lrml:Override over="#c36-effect" under="#c27-1"/></lrml:OverrideStatement>
    <lrml:OverrideStatement key="ov-c36-effect--c27-2-1"><lrml:Comment>被撤销监护人资格（第36条）的，不再依第27–33条担任监护人</lrml:Comment><lrml:Override over="#c36-effect" under="#c27-2-1"/></lrml:OverrideStatement>
    <lrml:OverrideStatement key="ov-c36-effect--c27-2-2"><lrml:Comment>被撤销监护人资格（第36条）的，不再依第27–33条担任监护人</lrml:Comment><lrml:Override over="#c36-effect" under="#c27-2-2"/></lrml:OverrideStatement>
    <lrml:OverrideStatement key="ov-c36-effect--c27-2-3"><lrml:Comment>被撤销监护人资格（第36条）的，不再依第27–33条担任监护人</lrml:Comment><lrml:Override over="#c36-effect" under="#c27-2-3"/></lrml:OverrideStatement>
    <lrml:OverrideStatement key="ov-c36-effect--c28-1"><lrml:Comment>被撤销监护人资格（第36条）的，不再依第27–33条担任监护人</lrml:Comment><lrml:Override over="#c36-effect" under="#c28-1"/></lrml:OverrideStatement>
    <lrml:OverrideStatement key="ov-c36-effect--c28-2"><lrml:Comment>被撤销监护人资格（第36条）的，不再依第27–33条担任监护人</lrml:Comment><lrml:Override over="#c36-effect" under="#c28-2"/></lrml:OverrideStatement>
    <lrml:OverrideStatement key="ov-c36-effect--c28-3"><lrml:Comment>被撤销监护人资格（第36条）的，不再依第27–33条担任监护人</lrml:Comment><lrml:Override over="#c36-effect" under="#c28-3"/></lrml:OverrideStatement>
    <lrml:OverrideStatement key="ov-c36-effect--c28-4"><lrml:Comment>被撤销监护人资格（第36条）的，不再依第27–33条担任监护人</lrml:Comment><lrml:Override over="#c36-effect" under="#c28-4"/></lrml:OverrideStatement>
    <lrml:OverrideStatement key="ov-c36-effect--c29-effect"><lrml:Comment>被撤销监护人资格（第36条）的，不再依第27–33条担任监护人</lrml:Comment><lrml:Override over="#c36-effect" under="#c29-effect"/></lrml:OverrideStatement>
    <lrml:OverrideStatement key="ov-c36-effect--c30"><lrml:Comment>被撤销监护人资格（第36条）的，不再依第27–33条担任监护人</lrml:Comment><lrml:Override over="#c36-effect" under="#c30"/></lrml:OverrideStatement>
    <lrml:OverrideStatement key="ov-c36-effect--c31-designated"><lrml:Comment>被撤销监护人资格（第36条）的，不再依第27–33条担任监护人</lrml:Comment><lrml:Override over="#c36-effect" under="#c31-designated"/></lrml:OverrideStatement>
    <lrml:OverrideStatement key="ov-c36-effect--c32"><lrml:Comment>被撤销监护人资格（第36条）的，不再依第27–33条担任监护人</lrml:Comment><lrml:Override over="#c36-effect" under="#c32"/></lrml:OverrideStatement>
    <lrml:OverrideStatement key="ov-c36-effect--c33"><lrml:Comment>被撤销监护人资格（第36条）的，不再依第27–33条担任监护人</lrml:Comment><lrml:Override over="#c36-effect" under="#c33"/></lrml:OverrideStatement>
    <lrml:OverrideStatement key="ov-c39-end--c27-1"><lrml:Comment>监护关系终止（第39条）的，不再担任监护人</lrml:Comment><lrml:Override over="#c39-end" under="#c27-1"/></lrml:OverrideStatement>
    <lrml:OverrideStatement key="ov-c39-end--c27-2-1"><lrml:Comment>监护关系终止（第39条）的，不再担任监护人</lrml:Comment><lrml:Override over="#c39-end" under="#c27-2-1"/></lrml:OverrideStatement>
    <lrml:OverrideStatement key="ov-c39-end--c27-2-2"><lrml:Comment>监护关系终止（第39条）的，不再担任监护人</lrml:Comment><lrml:Override over="#c39-end" under="#c27-2-2"/></lrml:OverrideStatement>
    <lrml:OverrideStatement key="ov-c39-end--c27-2-3"><lrml:Comment>监护关系终止（第39条）的，不再担任监护人</lrml:Comment><lrml:Override over="#c39-end" under="#c27-2-3"/></lrml:OverrideStatement>
    <lrml:OverrideStatement key="ov-c39-end--c28-1"><lrml:Comment>监护关系终止（第39条）的，不再担任监护人</lrml:Comment><lrml:Override over="#c39-end" under="#c28-1"/></lrml:OverrideStatement>
    <lrml:OverrideStatement key="ov-c39-end--c28-2"><lrml:Comment>监护关系终止（第39条）的，不再担任监护人</lrml:Comment><lrml:Override over="#c39-end" under="#c28-2"/></lrml:OverrideStatement>
    <lrml:OverrideStatement key="ov-c39-end--c28-3"><lrml:Comment>监护关系终止（第39条）的，不再担任监护人</lrml:Comment><lrml:Override over="#c39-end" under="#c28-3"/></lrml:OverrideStatement>
    <lrml:OverrideStatement key="ov-c39-end--c28-4"><lrml:Comment>监护关系终止（第39条）的，不再担任监护人</lrml:Comment><lrml:Override over="#c39-end" under="#c28-4"/></lrml:OverrideStatement>
    <lrml:OverrideStatement key="ov-c39-end--c29-effect"><lrml:Comment>监护关系终止（第39条）的，不再担任监护人</lrml:Comment><lrml:Override over="#c39-end" under="#c29-effect"/></lrml:OverrideStatement>
    <lrml:OverrideStatement key="ov-c39-end--c30"><lrml:Comment>监护关系终止（第39条）的，不再担任监护人</lrml:Comment><lrml:Override over="#c39-end" under="#c30"/></lrml:OverrideStatement>
    <lrml:OverrideStatement key="ov-c39-end--c31-designated"><lrml:Comment>监护关系终止（第39条）的，不再担任监护人</lrml:Comment><lrml:Override over="#c39-end" under="#c31-designated"/></lrml:OverrideStatement>
    <lrml:OverrideStatement key="ov-c39-end--c32"><lrml:Comment>监护关系终止（第39条）的，不再担任监护人</lrml:Comment><lrml:Override over="#c39-end" under="#c32"/></lrml:OverrideStatement>
    <lrml:OverrideStatement key="ov-c39-end--c33"><lrml:Comment>监护关系终止（第39条）的，不再担任监护人</lrml:Comment><lrml:Override over="#c39-end" under="#c33"/></lrml:OverrideStatement>
    <lrml:OverrideStatement key="ov-c39-end--c38-restored"><lrml:Comment>监护关系终止（第39条）的，不再担任监护人</lrml:Comment><lrml:Override over="#c39-end" under="#c38-restored"/></lrml:OverrideStatement>
    <lrml:OverrideStatement key="ov-c38-restored--c36-effect"><lrml:Comment>恢复监护人资格（第38条）优先于撤销的效果</lrml:Comment><lrml:Override over="#c38-restored" under="#c36-effect"/></lrml:OverrideStatement>
  </lrml:Statements>
</lrml:LegalRuleML>
